{"sections":[{"slug":"n-r-范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"n-r-范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"(n,r)-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"(n,r)-范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>$(n,r)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是满足如下条件的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其任何</span> $(n+2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶态射范畴为单点</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其任何</span> $r$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶态射范畴为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">不妨要求</span> $r\\leq n+1$, <span lang=\"zh\">因为若任何</span> $(n+2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶态射范畴为单点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则任何</span> $(n+1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶态射范畴为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$(-1,0)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/命题(同伦类型论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">命题</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>$(0,0)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/集合(同伦类型论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>$(0,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/偏序集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">偏序集</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>$(1,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴就是通常说的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>”.</li>\n<li>$(\\infty,0)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>$(\\infty,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是通常说的</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"”.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}